{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"2029","title":"Making friends within the Xiaomi community through Xiaomi Fan co-creation activities","desc":" Xiaomi Global Community has a new large-scale Xiaomi Fan engagement campaign in store, giving Xiaomi Fans another opportunity to build long-lasting friendships with other fans, while strengthening its community’s culture.","view_cnt":"1198","like_cnt":"3","add_time":"1627542638","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i01.appmifile.com/webfile/globalimg/PR/Making_friends_within_the.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003e\"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\" has been from the beginning of Xiaomi’s principle for fostering its community. In our latest effort, Xiaomi Global Community has a new large-scale Xiaomi Fan engagement campaign in store, giving Xiaomi Fans another opportunity to build long-lasting friendships with other fans, while strengthening its community’s culture.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-Mi and you, better together!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eXiaomi Fans have been an integral part of guiding Xiaomi to deliver products desired by them. To celebrate this, Xiaomi Fans decided on the slogan “Better Together” in 2019 to celebrate this bond. By 2020, “Better Together” made way for a series of interactive initiatives in the form of festivities celebrating how Xiaomi stands together with its fans. The activity was broken divided into two parts that the community could participate in, which included “Create Together” and “Contribute Together.” Through these activities, Xiaomi Community members could participate their own voice by answering 6 questionnaires that touched on topics including their user portrait, user habits, how the community is operated. The activity was continued by holding 6 core user online meetings that gave Xiaomi an in-depth look at its users’ needs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eBut this wasn’t all. The Xiaomi Community had also launched 5 “Design Together” initiatives to give community members a unique opportunity to exercise their creativity and showcase their artistic talent with the world. Xiaomi Community members could submit designs for new Xiaomi T-shirts, wallpapers, baseball caps, watch faces and even for Xiaomi’s yearly thematic song “\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eA Melody for Mi\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003e.” The call for creatives from the Xiaomi Community was heard around the world, as it exceeded 1,500 entries and 850,000 Page Views. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-center\"\u003e\u003csub style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\u003e3 baseball caps designed\u003c/sub\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-center\"\u003e\u003csub style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"\u003eA better together T-shirt design by Xiaomi Fan \u003c/sub\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-center\"\u003e\u003csub style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\u003e﻿Mobile wallpaper designed by Xiaomi Fans\u003c/sub\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eOf these creatives, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cem style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eA Melody for Mi, \u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003ea participatory project hosted by the Xiaomi Global Community was a hit. 1,000 Mi Fans from 15 countries around the world heard the call to submit their original music and lyrics. Ultimately 30 tracks from Xiaomi Fans were selected to compose a full track for \u003c/span\u003e\u003cem style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eA Melody for Mi\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003e. This track was made available as an official ringtone and uploaded to the Xiaomi Theme Store, making it available to download worldwide. In fact, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cem style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eA Melody for Mi \u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eis even played when waiting in our customer service hotline queue.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eA Melody for Mi\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003e expresses a Xiaomi Fans’ unceasing pursuit for a better life. This “better life,” is centered around love, passion, innovation, vitality, and a smarter lifestyle, have been reflective of the values that Xiaomi has sought to convey to its fans for the better part of a decade. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eToday however, the power is in the Xiaomi Fans’ hands in delivering the same message to the world and to its community. And the message of resolute confidence and belief in building a better world is resonating around the world. Princess Vargas, a Xiaomi Fan who participated in\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003e A Melody for Mi\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003e, suffered from anxiety, but found solace in this song. \"I would like to represent all the other people out there who have less confidence in themselves, I want to inspire you all to step up to listen to the small voice inside you and take a chance!”, Vargas explained.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-Show your hometown pride with a city mug!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eFor this year, Better Together had a new plan called the City Series. Like with previous initiatives, this series contains 3 activities, which includes the City Cup, City View and City Voice\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eWith City Cup, Xiaomi Fans were able to participate in designing a City Cup that celebrates the love for their own hometown. And this design would be featured in other real-world objects and sent out as gifts to Xiaomi Fans. With the excitement around this year’s initiatives, Xiaomi Fans from 8 different regions participated, collectively totaling more than 150 submissions. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"\u003eAlthough birthed in 2019, \"Better Together\" still stands strong and in the three years of activities to date. By listening to the feedback and opinion of Xiaomi Fans, we’ve closed the distance between Xiaomi as a brand, and its fans, the Xiaomi Global Community. In fact, we’d say that Xiaomi and its fans have become close friends.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"114","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1627542636"},"common":null}